  "id": "herbed-chicken-shepherd-s-pie",
  "name": "Herbed Chicken Shepherd’s Pie",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken and vegetables under a herbed potato crust",
  "description": "A savory baked casserole combining shredded chicken, green beans, green chilies, and herbs beneath Parmesan-topped mashed potatoes.",
